    "order": 6,
    "anchor": "3-determine-a-layout",
    "summary": "Each Primary Mission pairing has 3 recommended layouts, named A, B and C, shown in this companion and in the official Warhammer 40,000 app. As the organiser directs, players use the layout given or pick one at random.\n\nThe recommended order cycles A, B, C for as many rounds as the event has; the companion gives 5-, 6- and 8-round examples.",
